        <item>
            <title>wdrop 1.3.9</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:04:07 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>查看窗口的「用默认 App 打开」按钮不再显示两层轮廓</li><li>查看窗口按原格式显示富文本，包括网页复制的内容</li><li>底部栏多选条改用中性灰底，已选数量更醒目</li></ul>
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul><li>粘贴为纯文本和搜索时，不再漏掉随附件或图片一起复制的文字</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>The Open with Default App button in the View window no longer shows a double outline</li><li>The View window now shows rich text in its original formatting, including copied web content</li><li>Sheet selection bar now uses a neutral gray style with a clearer count</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Plain text paste and search no longer miss text copied with attachments or images</li></ul>]]></description>
